cdn.net/attachments/description/1336639/description_8ddd777b-1cd9-4f2e-a6cd-939719460e93.gif\" width=\"32\" height=\"32\"> Незеритовая чаша с аметистом:</span></h2><div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_fa2afc7f-e54d-43df-b00c-40800ba61b62.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_87d0084b-aa0c-42ae-b484-a1368c5494c3.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bc87e26b-5b5e-495f-a650-5631245a574e.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_4bb2f773-7865-4bea-94d7-b6d012e9a5a7.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_18814e2e-1a2a-4561-b68a-4594748181e5.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c10629d5-1f62-4081-9bc3-fe1bcd747d8f.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_9d910143-7daf-40f3-9dd7-ee4c052f0138.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_bcc9dd54-d7e5-4384-bee3-9c5822b4315f.png\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_618cbe15-1d00-4d67-91ed-34891bf6f996.png\"></p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p><hr><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_31e5b61c-9a4a-4de2-aee9-e1a735a8f7f1.png\" width=\"807\" height=\"92\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_ff6bde17-1257-4ce1-b6dc-c0bdba4f6726.png\" width=\"512\" height=\"421\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2fd30cb5-eb82-4492-9a08-4a079da21163.png\" width=\"703\" height=\"437\"></p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_31931c8d-89c1-4082-b92c-85ef688d818d.png\"></p><hr><h1